WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.820
Leave the admin console alone for half an hour, and it signs you out. Come back, and

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.095
it tells you why.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.775
Every request keeps a staff session open for thirty more minutes. The first one

00:00:14.775 --> 00:00:19.547
after thirty quiet minutes is refused, and the session ends on the server.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.240
Moving to another area checks the session. If it has expired, Staff sign in opens

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:29.034
and says so. A first visit, or a reload, says nothing.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.686
When the API refuses something staff may not see, the Staff only screen takes its

00:00:34.686 --> 00:00:39.614
place. Its heading takes focus, and the address bar keeps where they were going.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.182
Sign out ends that session. While it waits, the button says Signing out.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.151
Five wrong passwords in fifteen minutes now pause staff sign-in too, counted

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.035
together with the member app.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.575
On the server, the session renews on every request, not only after half its

00:01:02.575 --> 00:01:07.634
lifetime. A refused attempt is never counted, so nobody can stretch the pause.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.340
Next, Admin and Moderator roles.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.915
That's slice nine point three. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health

00:01:24.915 --> 00:01:26.354
in body and spirit.
